{"appid": 2459550, "gama": {"steamId": 2459550, "id": 2459550, "name": "Emberward", "copiesSold": 237831, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1719288000000, "releaseDate": 1789657219000, "earlyAccessExitDate": 1789657219000, "EAReleaseDate": 1719288000000, "price": 19.99, "developers": ["Refic Games"], "publishers": ["Refic Games"], "publisherClass": "Indie", "reviewScore": 97, "genres": ["Indie", "Strategy", "Free To Play"], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Falling Blocks", "Strategy", "Roguelite", "Deckbuilding", "Base Building", "3D", "Indie", "Singleplayer", "Roguelike", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Tactical", "Colorful", "Cartoony", "Building", "Fantasy", "Resource Management", "Top-Down", "Procedural Generation", "Stylized"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "余烬守卫 Emberward", "steam_appid": 2459550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/f18e44b4b2253b1b9ca9caec62b7808c.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/f18e44b4b2253b1b9ca9caec62b7808c.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在战斗前建造迷宫，快速的判断地形、路线，找出最适当的配置。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >善用手上有限的牆壁方块！是要让怪物绕路，或是让砲塔盖在更好的位置呢？</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战斗结束后，在新获得的方块上镶嵌符文！符文可以强化你的砲塔，给予方块特殊能力，或甚至让方块变成两倍大！ </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/dc90e97a3e1b46164bf7bbd36231b31a.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/dc90e97a3e1b46164bf7bbd36231b31a.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/772a3bdbbbb624930d5536251feec06e.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/772a3bdbbbb624930d5536251feec06e.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/772a3bdbbbb624930d5536251feec06e.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>各种尺寸的砲塔</strong>：1x3? 2x2? 3x3? 想要建造威力强大的砲塔需要良好的空间规划！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>横跨怪物路径的剧毒塔</strong>：用射的太慢了，我们直接把毒液撒在敌人头上！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>追踪敌人的无人机塔</strong>：谁说塔一定要原地等着敌人来？主动出击才是更好的防禦！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20面骰子塔</strong>：试试你的手气？骰出的点数越高伤害就越高！ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/470d64ce816fa3a51ec06168bf169f58.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/470d64ce816fa3a51ec06168bf169f58.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/a858fc1dfe5fbe11a671c1ced86ea7b7.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/a858fc1dfe5fbe11a671c1ced86ea7b7.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/a858fc1dfe5fbe11a671c1ced86ea7b7.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在冒险开始前，选择你的角色和携带的火源！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一场冒险都独一无二，不同的地图、不同的砲塔组合、不同的迷宫。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在旅程中收集新砲塔，取得稀有的牆壁卡，以及强大的神器。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每趟旅程都会累积经验，下一次出发时拥有更强大的能力。 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/fb7cff6a0ffd41e4c45faf2054038a07.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/fb7cff6a0ffd41e4c45faf2054038a07.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/11b0a0f01e0d0a753135c0118b48a1ec.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/11b0a0f01e0d0a753135c0118b48a1ec.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/11b0a0f01e0d0a753135c0118b48a1ec.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>冒险模式：</strong>挑战一连串关卡，并迎战强大的魔王！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>无尽模式：</strong>每日/每週挑战、特殊活动地图与超过 80 个自订关卡，争夺排行榜冠军！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>谜团圣殿：</strong>节奏更紧凑的游戏模式，运用有限的卡牌组合，打造最强防线！</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/f18e44b4b2253b1b9ca9caec62b7808c.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/f18e44b4b2253b1b9ca9caec62b7808c.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在战斗前建造迷宫，快速的判断地形、路线，找出最适当的配置。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >善用手上有限的牆壁方块！是要让怪物绕路，或是让砲塔盖在更好的位置呢？</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战斗结束后，在新获得的方块上镶嵌符文！符文可以强化你的砲塔，给予方块特殊能力，或甚至让方块变成两倍大！ </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s